# Route: guide 45 of 49 of the simulator's completionist route for Troll (1199
# of 1215 eligible quests, 157.3 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 59 to 60, 55
# quests, 2.9 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Winterspring, Ashenvale, Orgrimmar, Undercity, Western Plaguelands,
# Felwood, Stonetalon Mountains, Thunder Bluff, Tanaris, Un'Goro Crater):
# Frostfire Hot Springs -> Everlook -> The Hidden Grove -> Mazthoril ->
# Frostfire Hot Springs -> Night Run -> Felfire Hill -> near Orgrimmar ->
# Orgrimmar -> near Orgrimmar -> Undercity -> near Undercity -> Undercity ->
# ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): High Chief Winterfall (5121; High
# Chief Winterfall 59); The Final Piece (5123; High Chief Winterfall 59);
# Shadowshard Fragments (7068; Shadowshard Rumbler 40-41, Shadowshard Smasher
# 41-42, Shadowshard Thunderer 38); Necklace Recovery (2283; Shadowforge
# Surveyor 35-36, Shadowforge Ruffian 36-37, Shadowforge Digger 35-36,
# Stonevault Rockchewer 36-37, Stonevault Oracle 37-38, Stonevault Cave Hunter
# 36-37); Earthen Arise (6481; Goggeroc 20); It's Dangerous to Go Alone (3962;
# Blazerunner 56).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): Blackfathom Villainy (6561), Allegiance to the Old Gods
# (6565), Allegiance to the Old Gods (6565), Amongst the Ruins (6921), Amongst
# the Ruins (6921), Baron Aquanis (6922), Necklace Recovery, Take 2 (2284),
# Rig Wars (2841), Rig Wars (2841), The Royal Rescue (4003), For The Horde!
# (4974), Returning the Lost Satchel (5724), Hidden Enemies (5728), Hidden
# Enemies (5728), Slaying the Beast (5761), Slaying the Beast (5761), Changing
# Tastes (95697), Changing Tastes (95697), The Book of Ur (1013), The Book of
# Ur (1013), Going, Going, Guano! (1109), Going, Going, Guano! (1109), Bring
# the End (3341), The Power to Destroy... (5725), Light's Justice (92421),
# Light's Justice (92421), The New Plague (95216), Source of Power (96988),
# Doctor Theolen Krastinov, the Butcher (5382), Kirtonos the Herald (5384),
# The Lich, Ras Frostwhisper (5466), Krastinov's Bag of Horrors (5515), Of
# Love and Family (5848), Oculus Illusions (6569), Leaders of the Fang (914),
# Compendium of the Fallen (1049), A Vengeful Fate (1102), Testing an Enemy's
# Strength (5723), Divino-matic Rod (2768), Scarab Shells (2865), Troll Temper
# (3042), Into the Depths (3446), Secret of the Circle (3447), The Prophecy of
